#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.Cm ProxyCommand> and E<.Cm ProxyJump> accept the tokens %%, %h, %n, %p, "
